  Post-disclosure companion repository for the Waypoint T1–T275 blind comparative
  experiment. It preserves Bradley Carter's native PsiGuard disclosure coordinates,
  the frozen Aperture references used for comparison, source-turn joins, event-level
  results, exploratory analysis, claim boundaries, and methodological interpretation.
